        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "GST Guide for Freelancers — Kab Register Karna Hai (Part 2)",
        "content": "QRMP (Quarterly Return Monthly Payment) scheme chhote freelancers ke liye hai:\n\n| Scheme | Eligibility | Return Frequency | Payment Frequency |\n|--------|-------------|------------------|-------------------|\n| Regular | All | Monthly (GSTR-1, GSTR-3B) | Monthly |\n| QRMP | Turnover < ₹1.5 crore | Quarterly (GSTR-1, GSTR-3B) | Monthly (fixed amount) |\n\n**QRMP Benefits:**\n- Quarterly filing = less paperwork\n- Monthly payment = cash flow manageable\n- Fixed tax amount based on previous year\n\n**Filing Deadlines:**\n\n| Return | Monthly Filing | Quarterly Filing |\n|--------|---------------|------------------|\n| GSTR-1 (Sales) | 11th of next month | 13th of month after quarter |\n| GSTR-3B (Payment) | 20th of next month | 22nd/24th of month after quarter |\n\n### GST Rates for Different Services\n\n| Service Type | SAC Code | GST Rate | Example |\n|--------------|----------|----------|---------|\n| IT Software Services | 998314 | 18% | Web development, app development |\n| Other IT Services | 998319 | 18% | Design, writing, consulting |\n| Online Education | 999220 | 18% | Online courses, tutoring |\n| Photography | 998319 | 18% | Event photography, product photography |\n| Advertising | 998319 | 18% | Social media marketing |\n| Architecture | 998319 | 18% | Interior design, architecture |\n\n**Zero-Rated Supply (Export of Services):**\n- Services to clients outside India\n- GST rate: 0%\n- But you need LUT (Letter of Undertaking) or pay IGST\n- Can claim ITC refund\n\n**Amit's Export Strategy:**\nAmit (23, Pune) develops websites for US clients. His services are zero-rated (0% GST). He files LUT annually, doesn't collect GST from US clients, but claims ITC on all business expenses. His CA helps him get ITC refund every quarter!\n\n### GST Invoice Format and Requirements\n\nGST invoice mandatory hai jab GST register ho. Format:\n\n```\nTAX INVOICE\n\nInvoice No: AMT/2025-26/001\nDate: 15-July-2025\n\nFrom:\nAmit Web Solutions\nPAN: XXXXX1234X\nGSTIN: 27XXXXX1234X1Z5\nAddress: 123, Tech Park, Pune 411001\n\nTo:\nABC Corporation\nAddress: 456, Business Center, Mumbai 400001\n\nDescription of Services:\nWebsite Development - Phase 1: ₹50,000\nGST @ 18%: ₹9,000\nTotal: ₹59,000\n\nAmount in words: Fifty-Nine Thousand Rupees Only",
