        "title": "GST Guide for Freelancers — Kab Register Karna Hai (Part 3)",
        "content": "Bank Details:\nBank: HDFC Bank\nA/C No: XXXXXXXXXXXX\nIFSC: HDFC0001234\n\nFor Amit Web Solutions\nAuthorized Signatory\n```\n\n**Mandatory Fields on GST Invoice:**\n1. Invoice number (sequential)\n2. Date\n3. Supplier details (name, GSTIN, address)\n4. Recipient details (name, GSTIN if registered, address)\n5. Description of services\n6. HSN/SAC code\n7. Taxable value\n8. GST rate and amount (CGST + SGST or IGST)\n9. Total value\n10. Place of supply\n\n### Late Fees and Penalties\n\n| Non-Compliance | Penalty | Interest |\n|----------------|---------|----------|\n| Late GSTR-1 filing | ₹50/day (max ₹10,000) | NIL |\n| Late GSTR-3B filing | ₹50/day (max ₹10,000) | 18% p.a. on tax due |\n| Not registering for GST | ₹10,000 or 10% of tax due | 18% p.a. |\n| Wrong GST invoice | ₹25,000 | NIL |\n| Not paying GST | 10% of tax due minimum | 18% p.a. |\n\n**Sneha's Mistake:**\nSneha (24, Jaipur) registered for GST but forgot to file for 3 months. Penalty: ₹10,000 + interest ₹2,700. She now has automated reminders!\n\n### Real Example: Freelance Designer Earning ₹30 Lakh\n\n**Meera's Complete GST Calculation:**\n\n```\nMEERA DESIGN STUDIO\nAnnual Turnover: ₹30,00,000\nGST Registration: Mandatory (crossed ₹20 lakh)\n\nCOLLECTION FROM CLIENTS:\nClient A: ₹8,00,000 + 18% GST = ₹9,44,000\nClient B: ₹6,00,000 + 18% GST = ₹7,08,000\nClient C: ₹10,00,000 + 18% GST = ₹11,80,000\nPlatform income: ₹6,00,000 + 18% GST = ₹7,08,000\nTotal Collected: ₹35,40,000\nGST Collected: ₹5,40,000\n\nINPUT TAX CREDIT (ITC):\nLaptop (MacBook Pro): ₹1,50,000 → GST ₹27,000\nSoftware (Adobe CC): ₹60,000 → GST ₹10,800\nInternet: ₹36,000 → GST ₹6,480\nCo-working space: ₹1,20,000 → GST ₹21,600\nPhone: ₹15,000 → GST ₹2,700\nMarketing: ₹50,000 → GST ₹9,000\nClient meetings travel: ₹30,000 → GST ₹5,400\nProfessional courses: ₹40,000 → GST ₹7,200\nTotal ITC: ₹90,180\n\nNET GST LIABILITY:\nGST Collected: ₹5,40,000\nLess ITC: ₹90,180\nNet GST to pay: ₹4,49,820\n\nMEERA'S ACTUAL COST:\nTotal expenses: ₹4,51,000 (including GST)\nActual expense (excl GST): ₹3,60,820\nITC claimed: ₹90,180\nNet cost: ₹3,60,820\n\nWithout GST, Meera would have paid full ₹4,51,000.\nWith ITC, she saved ₹90,180!\n```\n\n---",
