        "title": "Advance Tax — Mahine Ka Paisa, Mahine Ka Tax",
        "content": "Advance tax samajhna hai toh socho — sarkar kehti hai ki agar tum zyada kama rahe ho, toh tax abhi do, saal ke end mein mat ruko!\n\n### What is Advance Tax?\n\nAdvance tax woh tax hai jo aap **saal ke beech mein** pay karte ho, saal ke end mein nahi. Freelancers ke liye yeh zaroori hai kyunki unke paas employer nahi jo TDS kaat ke government ko de.\n\n**Who Needs to Pay:**\n\n| Total Tax Liability | Advance Tax Required? |\n|---------------------|----------------------|\n| < ₹10,000 | No |\n| ≥ ₹10,000 | YES (Mandatory) |\n| Freelancers with > ₹50,000 income | Almost always YES |\n\n**Note:** Agar tumne already TDS kaatwaya hai clients se, toh usse advance tax mein adjust kar sakte ho.\n\n### Advance Tax Due Dates\n\n| Installment | Due Date | Cumulative % of Total Tax |\n|-------------|----------|---------------------------|\n| First | June 15 | 15% |\n| Second | September 15 | 45% |\n| Third | December 15 | 75% |\n| Fourth | March 15 | 100% |\n\n**Kunal's Calendar:**\nKunal expects to pay ₹80,000 tax this year. His schedule:\n\n| Date | Cumulative % | Amount | Payment Made |\n|------|--------------|--------|--------------|\n| June 15 | 15% | ₹12,000 | ₹12,000 |\n| September 15 | 45% | ₹36,000 | ₹24,000 (additional) |\n| December 15 | 75% | ₹60,000 | ₹24,000 (additional) |\n| March 15 | 100% | ₹80,000 | ₹20,000 (final) |\n\n### How to Calculate Advance Tax\n\n**Step 1: Estimate Total Income**\n```\nExpected Freelance Income: ₹_______\nAdd: Other Income (interest etc.): ₹_______\nTotal Expected Income: ₹_______\n```\n\n**Step 2: Apply Deductions**\n```\nSection 80C: ₹1,50,000 (max)\nSection 80D: ₹_______ (health insurance)\nSection 80CCD(1B): ₹50,000 (NPS)\nOther Deductions: ₹_______\nTotal Deductions: ₹_______\n```\n\n**Step 3: Calculate Taxable Income**\n```\nTotal Income - Deductions = Taxable Income\n```",
        "color": "#2563eb",
