        "title": "Advance Tax — Mahine Ka Paisa, Mahine Ka Tax (Part 3)",
        "content": "Now, pay ₹55,000 in installments:\nJune 15: 15% of ₹55,000 = ₹8,250\nSeptember 15: 30% of ₹55,000 = ₹16,500\nDecember 15: 30% of ₹55,000 = ₹16,500\nMarch 15: 25% of ₹55,000 = ₹13,750\n```\n\n### Real Example: Freelancer Earning ₹8 Lakh Quarterly\n\n**Sneha's Advance Tax Calculation:**\n\n```\nSNEHA CONTENT CREATIONS\nFY 2025-26 Estimated Income:\n\nQuarter 1 (Apr-Jun): ₹2,00,000\nQuarter 2 (Jul-Sep): ₹2,00,000\nQuarter 3 (Oct-Dec): ₹2,00,000\nQuarter 4 (Jan-Mar): ₹2,00,000\nTotal: ₹8,00,000\n\nDeductions:\nSection 80C (ELSS): ₹1,50,000\nSection 80D (Health Insurance): ₹25,000\nSection 80CCD(1B) (NPS): ₹50,000\nTotal Deductions: ₹2,25,000\n\nTaxable Income: ₹8,00,000 - ₹2,25,000 = ₹5,75,000\n\nTax Calculation (New Regime):\n0-₹3,00,000: NIL\n₹3,00,001-₹5,75,000: 5% of ₹2,75,000 = ₹13,750\nCess: 4% of ₹13,750 = ₹550\nTotal Tax: ₹14,300\n\nTDS Deducted: ₹8,000\nAdvance Tax Payable: ₹14,300 - ₹8,000 = ₹6,300\n\nINSTALLMENT SCHEDULE:\nJune 15: 15% of ₹6,300 = ₹945\nSeptember 15: 30% of ₹6,300 = ₹1,890\nDecember 15: 30% of ₹6,300 = ₹1,890\nMarch 15: 25% of ₹6,300 = ₹1,575\nTotal: ₹6,300\n```\n\n**Simple hai, right?** Sneha ne quarterly income estimate kiya, deductions lagaye, tax calculate kiya, aur installments mein pay kiya!\n\n---",
