        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Health Insurance for Freelancers — Self-Employed Ka Kavach (Part 2)",
        "content": "**Total Maximum Deduction:** ₹1,00,000 (if self + parents all senior citizens)\n\n**Priya's 80D Calculation:**\n```\nPriya's Health Insurance Premium: ₹12,000\nParents' Health Insurance Premium: ₹25,000\nPreventive Health Checkup: ₹5,000\n\nTotal 80D Deduction: ₹42,000\nTax Saved at 20%: ₹8,400\n```\n\n### Portability and Waiting Periods\n\n**Portability:**\n- You can port (transfer) health insurance from one insurer to another\n- No loss of waiting period credit\n- Must apply 45 days before policy expiry\n- All benefits continue\n\n**Waiting Periods:**\n\n| Waiting Period | Duration | What It Means |\n|----------------|----------|---------------|\n| Initial | 30 days | No claims for first 30 days |\n| Pre-existing | 2-4 years | Diseases before policy not covered |\n| Specific Diseases | 2-4 years | Listed diseases not covered |\n| Permanent Exclusions | Lifetime | Cosmetic, self-inflicted etc. |\n\n### Real Example: Freelancer Family Health Insurance\n\n**Rahul's Health Insurance Plan:**\n\n```\nRAHUL'S FAMILY HEALTH INSURANCE\n\nFamily Members:\n- Rahul (28)\n- Wife (26)\n- Daughter (2)\n- Parents (55 & 52)\n\nPLAN 1: Individual Health Insurance\nRahul: ₹10 lakh coverage\nPremium: ₹8,000/year\n\nPLAN 2: Family Floater\nWife + Daughter: ₹10 lakh coverage\nPremium: ₹12,000/year\n\nPLAN 3: Parents Health Insurance\nParents: ₹10 lakh coverage\nPremium: ₹25,000/year\n\nTOTAL COVERAGE: ₹30 lakh\nTOTAL PREMIUM: ₹45,000/year\n\nTAX BENEFIT:\nSelf + Family (80D): ₹25,000\nParents (80D): ₹25,000\nTotal Deduction: ₹50,000\nTax Saved (30%): ₹15,000\n\nNET COST: ₹45,000 - ₹15,000 = ₹30,000/year\n\nFor ₹30 lakh coverage, net cost is just ₹30,000!\nThat's ₹2,500/month for complete family protection!\n```\n\n**Emergency Fund Benefit:**\nWithout insurance, a ₹10 lakh hospital bill would wipe out 2+ years of savings!\nWith insurance, Rahul's emergency fund stays intact.\n\n### Health Insurance Claim Process — Step by Step\n\nJab hospital jaana ho, toh yeh steps follow karo:\n\n**Step 1: Pre-Authorization**\n- Hospital se contact karo (cashless facility ke liye)\n- Insurance card dikhaao\n- Hospital insurer ko details bhejega\n- Approval aayega (usually 2-4 hours)\n\n**Step 2: Hospitalization**\n- Documents ready rakho: Insurance card, ID proof, doctor's prescription\n- Hospital admission form fill karo\n- Confirm cashless ya reimbursement mode",
