        "content": "Freelancers ki income irregular hoti hai — kabhi ₹2 lakh, kabhi ₹20,000. Cash flow management is survival skill!\n\n### Professional Invoice Format\n\nInvoice professional honi chahiye — client ko trust aata hai, aur payment jaldi milta hai!\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n                        TAX INVOICE\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nInvoice Number: PRI/2025-26/042\nDate: 15th July, 2025\nDue Date: 14th August, 2025 (Net 30)\n\nFROM:\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nPriya Content Solutions\nPriya Sharma\nPAN: XXXXX1234X\nGSTIN: 06XXXXX1234X1Z5 (if registered)\nAddress: 456, Writer's Lane, Jaipur 302001\nEmail: priya@content.com\nPhone: +91-98765-43210\n\nTO:\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nABC Marketing Pvt. Ltd.\nRahul Mehta (Marketing Head)\nAddress: 789, Business Park, Delhi 110001\nGSTIN: 07XXXXX5678X1Z5\nEmail: rahul@abcmarketing.com\n\nDESCRIPTION OF SERVICES:\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nS.No  Description                  Qty    Rate      Amount\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1     Blog Content Writing         10     ₹2,500    ₹25,000\n      (10 articles × 1500 words)\n\n2     Social Media Captions        30     ₹200      ₹6,000\n      (30 captions for Instagram)\n\n3     Email Newsletter Copy        4      ₹3,000    ₹12,000\n      (4 weekly newsletters)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                              Subtotal: ₹43,000\n                              GST @18%: ₹7,740\n                              TOTAL: ₹50,740\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nAmount in words: Fifty Thousand Seven Hundred Forty Rupees Only\n\nPAYMENT DETAILS:\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBank: HDFC Bank\nA/C Name: Priya Content Solutions\nA/C No: XXXXXXXXXXXX\nIFSC: HDFC0001234\nUPI: priya@okicici\n\nTERMS & CONDITIONS:\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Payment due within 30 days of invoice date\n2. Late payment attracts 1.5% monthly interest\n3. disputes subject to Jaipur jurisdiction\n4. TDS applicable under Section 194J\n\nFor Priya Content Solutions\n[Signature]\nPriya Sharma\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n                         Thank you for your business!\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n\n### Payment Terms and Follow-up Strategies\n\n**Payment Terms Types:**\n\n| Term | Meaning | Best For |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Net 15 | Pay within 15 days | Small projects |\n| Net 30 | Pay within 30 days | Standard projects |\n| Net 45 | Pay within 45 days | Large projects |\n| Net 60 | Pay within 60 days | Corporate clients |\n| 50% Advance | Half now, half on completion | New clients |\n| Milestone | Pay at project milestones | Long projects |\n\n**Follow-up Email Templates:**\n\n**Template 1: Friendly Reminder (Day 1 after due date)**\n```\nSubject: Gentle Reminder - Invoice PRI/2025-26/042",
