        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Invoice Management Aur Cash Flow Planning (Part 2)",
        "content": "Hi [Client Name],\n\nHope you're doing well! This is a friendly reminder that Invoice \nPRI/2025-26/042 for ₹50,740 was due on [Date]. \n\nCould you please confirm when I can expect the payment?\n\nThanks!\n[Your Name]\n```\n\n**Template 2: Follow-up (7 days after due)**\n```\nSubject: Follow-up - Payment Pending - Invoice PRI/2025-26/042\n\nHi [Client Name],\n\nI wanted to follow up on the pending payment for Invoice \nPRI/2025-26/042 (₹50,740), which was due on [Date].\n\nPlease let me know if there are any issues with the payment \nprocess. I'm happy to help!\n\nBest,\n[Your Name]\n```\n\n**Template 3: Firm Reminder (14 days after due)**\n```\nSubject: URGENT: Payment Overdue - Invoice PRI/2025-26/042\n\nHi [Client Name],\n\nThis is a reminder that Invoice PRI/2025-26/042 (₹50,740) is \nnow 14 days overdue.\n\nAs per our agreement, late payment attracts 1.5% monthly interest. \nPlease process the payment immediately to avoid additional charges.\n\nPlease confirm the payment date.\n\nRegards,\n[Your Name]\n```\n\n### Managing Irregular Income\n\n**Income Smoothing Strategy:**\n\n| Month | Income | Expected Average | Surplus/Deficit |\n|-------|--------|------------------|-----------------|\n| April | ₹80,000 | ₹50,000 | +₹30,000 |\n| May | ₹30,000 | ₹50,000 | -₹20,000 |\n| June | ₹60,000 | ₹50,000 | +₹10,000 |\n| July | ₹40,000 | ₹50,000 | -₹10,000 |\n| August | ₹70,000 | ₹50,000 | +₹20,000 |\n| September | ₹20,000 | ₹50,000 | -₹30,000 |\n\n**Strategy:**\n1. Calculate average monthly income\n2. Keep 3-6 months expenses in savings account\n3. Transfer surplus months to \"buffer fund\"\n4. Use buffer fund in deficit months\n5. Keep emergency fund separate (9-12 months)",
