        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Freelancer Tax Calendar — Poora Saal Ka Schedule",
        "content": "Freelancers ke liye tax planning全年 calendar banana zaroori hai. Ek bhi deadline miss karo = penalty!\n\n### Month-by-Month Tax Planning Calendar\n\n| Month | Key Activities | Deadline | Action Items |\n|-------|---------------|----------|--------------|\n| **April** | New FY begins | - | - Start fresh records - Set up expense tracking - Review previous year ITR |\n| **May** | - | - | - Update investment proofs - Check TDS certificates - Plan advance tax |\n| **June** | Advance Tax 1st Installment | June 15 | - Pay 15% of total tax - Save challan receipt |\n| **July** | ITR Filing | July 31 | - File ITR for previous FY - Verify within 30 days - Check TDS refunds |\n| **August** | - | - | - Review expense records - Plan investments for 80C/80D |\n| **September** | Advance Tax 2nd Installment | September 15 | - Pay 45% cumulative - Update cash flow forecast |\n| **October** | - | - | - Mid-year tax review - Adjust advance tax estimate |\n| **November** | - | - | - Year-end tax planning - Maximize deductions |\n| **December** | Advance Tax 3rd Installment | December 15 | - Pay 75% cumulative - Review investment portfolio |\n| **January** | - | - | - Final tax calculation - Plan March payment |\n| **February** | - | - | - Collect all receipts - Prepare documents |\n| **March** | Advance Tax Final Installment | March 15 | - Pay 100% tax - Before March 31 |\n\n### Important Deadlines Checklist\n\n| Deadline | What | Penalty for Missing |\n|----------|------|---------------------|\n| June 15 | Advance Tax 1st Installment | 1% interest per month |\n| July 31 | ITR Filing | ₹1,000-₹5,000 penalty |\n| September 15 | Advance Tax 2nd Installment | 1% interest per month |\n| October 31 | ITR Verification | ITR treated as not filed |\n| December 15 | Advance Tax 3rd Installment | 1% interest per month |\n| March 15 | Advance Tax Final Installment | 1% interest per month |\n| March 31 | End of FY | - |\n\n### Penalty Calendar for Missing Deadlines\n\n| Missed Deadline | Penalty Amount | Interest Rate |\n|-----------------|----------------|---------------|\n| ITR Filing (July 31) | ₹1,000-₹5,000 | NIL |\n| ITR Verification | ITR invalid | NIL |\n| Advance Tax Installment | NIL | 1% p.m. on shortfall |\n| GST Return Filing | ₹50/day (max ₹10,000) | 18% p.a. on tax due |\n| Professional Tax | ₹200-₹1,000 | 1.25% per month |\n\n### How to Set Up Reminders\n\n**Method 1: Google Calendar**\n```\nCreate Events:\n1. \"Pay Advance Tax 1st Installment\" - June 10 (5 days early)\n2. \"File ITR\" - July 25 (6 days early)\n3. \"Verify ITR\" - August 25 (before 30-day deadline)\n4. \"Pay Advance Tax 2nd Installment\" - September 10\n5. \"Pay Advance Tax 3rd Installment\" - December 10\n6. \"Pay Advance Tax Final Installment\" - March 10\n```\n\n**Method 2: Phone Reminders**\n- Set recurring reminders\n- Use apps like Todoist, Notion\n- WhatsApp reminders to self\n\n**Method 3: CA Reminder**\n- Ask CA to send reminders\n- Pay for reminder service\n- Professional tracking\n\n**Aman's Calendar Setup:**\nAman uses Google Calendar with:\n- Monthly tax review (1st of every month)\n- Quarterly advance tax (10th of installments)\n- ITR filing (July 20)\n- Investment proofs (March 15)",
