        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Freelancer Tax Calendar — Poora Saal Ka Schedule (Part 2)",
        "content": "Result: Zero penalties for 3 years!\n\n### Quarterly Tax Planning Checklist\n\nHar quarter end pe yeh checklist follow karo:\n\n**Q1 (April-June):**\n- [ ] Previous FY tax payment proof save karo\n- [ ] Advance tax 1st installment pay karo (June 15)\n- [ ] New FY ke liye budget banao\n- [ ] Investment plans set karo\n\n**Q2 (July-September):**\n- [ ] ITR file karo (July 31)\n- [ ] ITR verify karo (within 30 days)\n- [ ] TDS refund status check karo\n- [ ] Advance tax 2nd installment pay karo (September 15)\n\n**Q3 (October-December):**\n- [ ] Mid-year tax review karo\n- [ ] Advance tax estimate adjust karo\n- [ ] Advance tax 3rd installment pay karo (December 15)\n- [ ] Year-end tax planning shuru karo\n\n**Q4 (January-March):**\n- [ ] Final tax calculation karo\n- [ ] Advance tax final installment pay karo (March 15)\n- [ ] Investments complete karo for 80C/80D\n- [ ] Expense records finalize karo\n- [ ] CA se mil lo for ITR preparation\n\n### Monthly Tax Planning Tasks\n\n| Month | Task | Time Needed |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| Every Month | Update expense records | 30 minutes |\n| Every Month | Check bank statements | 15 minutes |\n| Every Month | Review cash flow | 30 minutes |\n| Every Month | Save tax amount | 15 minutes |\n| Every Month | Update client invoices | 30 minutes |\n\n**Priya's Monthly Routine:**\n```\n1st of every month:\n1. Update Google Sheet with expenses (30 min)\n2. Check all bank accounts (15 min)\n3. Review client payments pending (15 min)\n4. Transfer tax amount to savings (5 min)\n5. Update investment tracker (10 min)\n\nTotal time: 75 minutes/month\nResult: Zero tax surprises!\n```\n\n### Tax Planning for New Freelancers",
