        "content": "Ab 6 detailed case studies dekhte hain — real examples se seekho!\n\n### Case Study 1: Graphic Designer Earning ₹8 Lakh\n\n**AMIT - Freelance Graphic Designer**\nAge: 24 | Location: Pune | Experience: 2 years\n\n**Income Breakdown:**\n\n| Source | Amount |\n|--------|--------|\n| Client A (logo design) | ₹2,00,000 |\n| Client B (branding) | ₹3,00,000 |\n| Platform income (Fiverr) | ₹2,50,000 |\n| Misc projects | ₹50,000 |\n| **Total** | **₹8,00,000** |\n\n**Deductions (Actual Expenses):**\n\n| Expense | Amount |\n|---------|--------|\n| Laptop (2 years old) | ₹15,000 (depreciation) |\n| Software (Adobe CC) | ₹30,000 |\n| Internet | ₹12,000 |\n| Phone | ₹5,000 |\n| Office supplies | ₹3,000 |\n| Online courses | ₹8,000 |\n| **Total** | **₹73,000** |\n\n**Tax Calculation Comparison:**\n\n```\nOPTION A: Actual Expenses\nGross Income: ₹8,00,000\nLess Expenses: ₹73,000\nTaxable: ₹7,27,000\n\nTax (Old Regime):\n- Standard Deduction: ₹50,000\n- 80C (PPF): ₹1,50,000\n- 80D (Health Insurance): ₹15,000\nTaxable after deductions: ₹5,12,000\nTax: ₹12,500\n\nOPTION B: 44ADA (50% deduction)\nGross Income: ₹8,00,000\n50% Deduction: ₹4,00,000\nTaxable: ₹4,00,000\n\nTax (Old Regime):\n- Standard Deduction: ₹50,000\n- 80C: ₹1,50,000\nTaxable after deductions: ₹2,00,000\nTax: ZERO (87A rebate)\n\nBEST OPTION: 44ADA + Old Regime\nFINAL TAX: ZERO!\nTDS REFUND: ₹15,000 (already deducted)\n```\n\n**Savings Achieved:**\n- Tax saved vs actual expenses: ₹12,500\n- TDS refund: ₹15,000\n- Total benefit: ₹27,500\n\n---\n\n### Case Study 2: Content Writer Earning ₹15 Lakh\n\n**PRIYA - Freelance Content Writer**\nAge: 26 | Location: Jaipur | Experience: 4 years\n\n**Income Breakdown:**\n\n| Source | Amount |\n|--------|--------|\n| Retainer clients (3) | ₹9,00,000 |\n| One-time projects | ₹4,00,000 |\n| Online course sales | ₹2,00,000 |\n| **Total** | **₹15,00,000** |\n\n**GST Analysis:**\n\n```\nIncome: ₹15,00,000 (< ₹20 lakh)\nGST Registration: NOT REQUIRED (optional)\n\nBut Priya wants to look professional and claim ITC.\nShe registers for GST voluntarily.\n\nGST Collected (18%): ₹2,70,000\nITC Available: ₹45,000\nNet GST: ₹2,25,000\n```\n\n**Advance Tax Calculation:**\n\n```\nTotal Tax Liability: ₹1,50,000 (approx)\nLess TDS: ₹50,000\nAdvance Tax: ₹1,00,000\n\nInstallments:\nJune 15: 15% = ₹15,000\nSeptember 15: 45% = ₹45,000 (cumulative)\nDecember 15: 75% = ₹75,000 (cumulative)\nMarch 15: 100% = ₹1,00,000 (cumulative)\n```\n\n**Tax Calculation (44ADA + Old Regime):**\n\n```\nGross Income: ₹15,00,000\n50% Deduction (44ADA): ₹7,50,000\nTaxable: ₹7,50,000\n\nDeductions:\n- Standard: ₹50,000\n- 80C: ₹1,50,000\n- 80D: ₹25,000\n- 80CCD(1B): ₹50,000\nTotal: ₹2,75,000\n\nNet Taxable: ₹4,75,000\nTax: ₹12,500\n```\n\n**Final Position:**\n- Tax liability: ₹12,500\n- TDS deducted: ₹50,000\n- Advance tax paid: ₹1,00,000\n- Refund: ₹1,37,500\n\n---",
